@file ComparatorChallenges/KadisonRingrose.lean
@decl OAI.BoundedHochschild.KadisonRingrose.main_result
-- L4DEL: title: Challenge statement: The Kadison–Ringrose cohomology conjecture
-- L4DEL: intuition: The formalization proves vanishing of bounded Hochschild cohomology in every degree at least two for a complex von Neumann algebra with coefficients in itself. Every bounded multilinear cocycle of such a degree is the Hochschild differential of a bounded multilinear cochain one degree lower. No separability or type restriction is imposed. The degree-one inner-derivation theorem is outside this selected statement.
-- L4DEL: step: This is an exact comparator target linked by the pinned repository's formalization note for this result.
-- L4DEL: step: The repository's comparator configuration selects OAI.Analysis.BoundedHochschild.MainResult as the released solution module checked against this declaration.

