@file ComparatorChallenges/PattersonFirstMoment.lean
@decl OAI.CubicFirstMoment.patterson_angularCancellation
-- L4DEL: title: Challenge statement: Patterson's first moment for cubic Gauss sums
-- L4DEL: intuition: Patterson's first-moment conjecture concerns the average of normalized cubic Gauss sums over primary Eisenstein primes. The formalization proves the sharp-cutoff asymptotic with main term $\frac65c_*X^{5/6}/\log X$, where $c_*=(2\pi)^{2/3}/(3\Gamma(2/3))$. It also proves the corresponding angular comparison for every integer Fourier mode and cancellation of order $o(X^{5/6}/\log X)$ for each fixed nonzero mode. All primary Eisenstein primes are included, without an extra conjectural premise.
-- L4DEL: step: This is an exact comparator target linked by the pinned repository's formalization note for this result.
-- L4DEL: step: The repository's comparator configuration selects OAI.NumberTheory.CubicMoment.Theta.CubicThetaMains as the released solution module checked against this declaration.

