-- L4DEL: step: This is an exact comparator target linked by the pinned repository's formalization note for this result.
-- L4DEL: step: The repository's comparator configuration selects OAI.NumberTheory.CubicMoment.Theta.CubicThetaMains as the released solution module checked against this declaration.

