@file ComparatorChallenges/PinchedKahler.lean
@decl OAI.PinchedHartogs.controlled_potential
-- L4DEL: title: Challenge statement: Negative Kähler curvature without bounded holomorphic coordinates
-- L4DEL: intuition: The formalized result constructs a nonempty contractible complex threefold with a complete Kähler metric whose real sectional curvatures lie between two fixed negative constants. Nevertheless, it has no system of bounded holomorphic coordinates and is not biholomorphic to a bounded domain. The metric is obtained from an explicitly controlled potential. This is the negatively pinched construction; the different companion with only one-sided curvature control is separate.
-- L4DEL: step: This is an exact comparator target linked by the pinned repository's formalization note for this result.
-- L4DEL: step: The repository's comparator configuration selects OAI.Geometry.Kahler.Main as the released solution module checked against this declaration.

