@file ComparatorChallenges/ThomasonModelStructures.lean
@decl OAI.Thomason.main
-- L4DEL: title: Challenge statement: Thomason model structures in all strict higher dimensions
-- L4DEL: intuition: The formalization proves the higher-dimensional Thomason model-structure theorem for small strict globular $n$-categories in every positive finite dimension and in dimension $\omega$. Each category has the stated proper combinatorial model structure, Quillen equivalent to simplicial sets through the twice-subdivided categorification and twice-extended Street nerve adjunction. The selected statements also identify weak equivalences by the Street nerve in all these dimensions. Thus the constructions model the homotopy theory of spaces throughout the stated range.
-- L4DEL: step: This is an exact comparator target linked by the pinned repository's formalization note for this result.
-- L4DEL: step: The repository's comparator configuration selects OAI.CategoryTheory.Thomason.RankedFaithfulness as the released solution module checked against this declaration.

